#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD0061 expect=violation domain=DM
#note "The Define-XML sidecar declares ItemGroupDefs DM and AE, but the study submits only a DM dataset -> AE is referenced in the define but missing from the study -> fires."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#define-xml FDA-SD0061-define.xml
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset DM label="Demographics"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
---
S1 | DM | S1-001
